        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.114,
            0.083,
            0.745,
            0.214
          ],
          "content": "What do we infer from the observations listed in Table 10.2? As we know, leaves are mostly green because of the presence of chlorophyll. We have also seen that the starch is produced where green patches of the leaf are present. We can infer that chlorophyll helps in preparing starch in the presence of sunlight. In fact, it is essential for the preparation of starch. Hence, the leaves are also called ‘food factories’ of plants."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.114,
            0.214,
            0.743,
            0.254
          ],
          "content": "What else is essential for the preparation of food in plants? Let us find out."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.116,
            0.264,
            0.68,
            0.288
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "10.2.2 Role of air in the preparation of food10.2.2 Role of air in the preparation of food"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "bbox": [
            0.107,
            0.291,
            0.274,
            0.437
          ],
          "content": "",
          "captions": [],
          "footnotes": [],
          "image_source": "images/page_6_image_4.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.276,
            0.323,
            0.622,
            0.397
          ],
          "content": "While reading contributions of While reading contributions of scientists in plant nutrition, my sisterscien told me that air plays a role in the process of food preparation in plants."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.445,
            0.426,
            0.7,
            0.483
          ],
          "content": "Which gas from the air is essential in the process of food preparation in plants?"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "bbox": [
            0.707,
            0.377,
            0.838,
            0.515
          ],
          "content": "",
          "captions": [],
